+// Evidence for a decision that is not being taken yet.
+//
+// A proposed change makes PrepareExecutableRegionForWriting return bool
+// and fails the executable allocation when preparation did not happen.
+// Today an unprepared region simply runs interpreted, which is the
+// normal exercised path; after that change it becomes a failed
+// executable allocation, which SpiderMonkey surfaces as OOM. The same
+// change removes the SIGBUS skip below, so both survival paths would go
